      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "mcpDiagramId": "etxUvU_JfZ",
        "mcpNodeId": "root_start",
        "mcpDiagram": {
          "tool": "create_mermaid_diagram",
          "mermaid": "stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Todo : tracker sync, or fleetc ticket new or propose\n  Todo --> InProgress : Spawn worker, claim (fleetd)\n  InProgress --> InQa : Handoff (fleetd)\n  Todo --> InQa : Handoff of a hand, never claimed (fleetd)\n  InQa --> Done : MR merged, Reap (fleetd)\n  InProgress --> Done : hand reports done, or MR merged, Reap (fleetd)\n  InProgress --> Todo : rework (a worker's) or recall (operator)\n  InQa --> Todo : rework (a worker's) or recall (operator)\n  Todo --> Blocked : tracker only\n  Blocked --> Todo : tracker, rework or recall (operator)\n  Todo --> Cancelled : decommission or proposal drop\n  InProgress --> Cancelled : decommission (operator)\n  InQa --> Cancelled : decommission (operator)\n  Blocked --> Cancelled : decommission (operator)\n  Done --> [*]\n  Cancelled --> [*]\n  note right of Todo : held overlays any status, set by anchor, convoy anchor, recall or the ruling cap. Off the frontier, no worker or sailor (a hand still spawns, the cap's sailor waits), arm refused, MR disarmed and drafted\n  note right of Done : Reap rolls a parent story or epic up to Done once all its children end, unless it is a standing convoy\n  class Done success\n  class Cancelled muted\n  class Blocked warning\n  class InQa pending",
          "options": {},
          "type": "state",
          "title": "Ticket status (as fleetd drives the tracker)",
          "editable": true
        }
      }
    },
