        "mcpDiagram": {
          "tool": "create_mermaid_diagram",
          "mermaid": "stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Active : convoy open (operator or admiral), refused NOT-OURS\n  Active --> Anchored : anchor --convoy (its open tickets too), or sink its captain\n  Anchored --> Active : weigh --convoy, releases those tickets\n  Active --> Closed : convoy close, no open proposals, a captain never closes a standing one\n  Anchored --> Closed : convoy close, same guards\n  Closed --> Active : convoy open again, NOT-OURS re-checked\n  Closed --> Anchored : convoy open again, if closed while anchored\n  class Active success\n  class Anchored muted\n  class Closed muted",
          "options": {},
          "type": "state",
          "title": "Convoy",
          "editable": true
        }
      }
    },
