          "tool": "create_mermaid_diagram",
          "mermaid": "stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Open : fleetc propose (cog), a new ticket filed now fleet-proposed, or an existing one\n  Open --> Accepted : proposal accept, label off, joins its convoy if any (operator or admiral)\n  Open --> Dropped : proposal drop, a fleet-proposed ticket Cancelled (operator or admiral)\n  Accepted --> [*]\n  Dropped --> [*]\n  note right of Open : an open proposal bound for a convoy blocks its close\n  class Accepted success\n  class Dropped muted",
          "options": {},
          "type": "state",
          "title": "Proposal",
          "editable": true
        }
      }
