      "text": "a fleetc ruling with no case awaiting\none is a standalone case, ruled at\nonce. A ruling on a capped case also\nweighs the ticket, so the count\nrestarts",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
