      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "mcpDiagramId": "4ki1leKT42",
        "mcpDiagram": {
          "tool": "create_mermaid_diagram",
          "mermaid": "stateDiagram-v2\n  state \"implementing\" as Working\n  [*] --> Working : Spawn, Ready or stacked (fleetd)\n  Working --> Trials : status trials, MR head is HEAD (cog)\n  Trials --> Working : TrialsWake, red, repair (fleetd)\n  Trials --> Review : TrialsWake, green (fleetd)\n  Review --> Working : ReviewWake, head reviewed (fleetd)\n  Working --> Waiting : status waiting (cog)\n  Waiting --> Working : Wake, blockers merged (fleetd)\n  Working --> Concluded : status concluded, reviewed, 0 threads (cog)\n  Concluded --> [*] : Handoff to a sailor (fleetd)\n  Working --> Escalated : status escalated (cog)\n  Escalated --> Working : REFUTE or ruling, cog resumes\n  Working --> Anchored : status anchored (cog)\n  Anchored --> Working : weigh (operator)\n  note left of Trials : trial_rounds (5) red, fleetd says escalate\n  note right of Review : review_rounds (5) with threads open, fleetd says escalate\n  note right of Anchored : dead - Heal in place (a paused one once its wake is due, never Anchored). Reap from any state\n  class Concluded success\n  class Escalated warning\n  class Anchored muted\n  class Trials pending\n  class Review pending\n  class Waiting pending",
          "options": {},
          "type": "state",
          "title": "Worker",
          "editable": true
        }
      },
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "text": "Reconcile pass (fleetd, every reconcile_secs)",
