      "text": "1 · Dispatch\neach order whose builder is due:\na hand, whatever the status;\na worker, Ready or stacked off its fork\n→ Spawn",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "j4Us198FNnYU4bghJZK-r",
      "originalText": "1 · Dispatch\neach order whose builder is due:\na hand, whatever the status;\na worker, Ready or stacked off its fork\n→ Spawn",
