      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "2 · Our ships\nmerged, a cog or order left → Reap\nopen, ours, not held or To Do,\nno cog on it, threads settled,\nchanged or needs work\n→ LaunchSailor, or Capped at max_rulings",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "5BF87lB_HvtPCJ4n5qlkG",
